 "_": "knos-sync's links (E4): each entry is one fact, every place it is stated, the command that gives its true value, the expected value and the comparator. Pointers register facts knos-sync does not check: an existing check holds them (E1), or their source is outside the repository. No kind blocks until a person turns blocking on for version, hash or count, and an entry blocks only after a person confirms it (knos-sync confirm).",
